      "cooked": "<p>On the sidebar of the new ERPNext 16 I can see the modules in the ERPNext and in the Frappe Framework but I can’t move to the custom app modules unless I edit it from the URL or add a workspace sidebar, a desktop icon then go far back to the desktop, and enter the workspace from there.</p>\n<p>Also I can’t add several tabs in the sidebar of the new customized workspace. And I can’t add a new customized workspace to the already there standard modules …</p>\n<p>There is something completely messed up in the new workspaces <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/sweat_smile.png?v=14\" title=\":sweat_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sweat_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/d/edbee63fe0efea10b16ae982604a8fd202b860a2.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/edbee63fe0efea10b16ae982604a8fd202b860a2\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/d/edbee63fe0efea10b16ae982604a8fd202b860a2.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"xVc9XlFn9MdDgvMlBhHUQu6g8Xo\" width=\"610\" height=\"356\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">610×356 36.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
